WEBVTT

00:00:00.016 --> 00:00:02.310
"Platform 9 3/4"?

00:00:02.519 --> 00:00:07.315
But, Hagrid, there must be a mistake.
This says platform 9 3/4.

00:00:07.524 --> 00:00:10.860
There's no such thing, is there?

00:00:29.379 --> 00:00:30.964
Man: Sorry.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.218
Excuse me. Excuse me.

00:00:35.427 --> 00:00:36.970
On your left.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.016
Can you tell me where
I might find platform 9 3/4?

00:00:41.224 --> 00:00:43.727
Think you're being funny, do you?

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:47.314
Mrs. Weasley: It's the same
every year, packed with Muggles.

00:00:47.731 --> 00:00:51.151
- Muggles?
- Mrs. Weasley: Platform 9 3/4, this way.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:59.993
All right, Percy, you first.

00:01:09.961 --> 00:01:11.171
Fred, you next.

00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:15.091
- He's not Fred, I am.
- You call yourself our mother?

00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:17.260
I'm sorry, George.

00:01:21.389 --> 00:01:23.767
I'm onlyjoking. I am Fred.

00:01:29.606 --> 00:01:32.192
Excuse me.

00:01:33.276 --> 00:01:36.071
Could you tell me how to...?

00:01:36.279 --> 00:01:39.783
How to get onto the platform?
Not to worry, dear.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.494
It's Ron's first time
to Hogwarts as well.

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:48.625
All you do is walk straight at the wall
between platforms 9 and 10.

00:01:48.792 --> 00:01:52.295
- Best to run if you're nervous.
- Good luck.

